# PERF-005 Phase 1: where the mispredicts come from. The baseline set of
# perf/studies/baseline.sets, unchanged, on the harness with the decision
# probes (perf_top dp2_*, dp3_*) and the reason columns (rs_*, rm_*). The
# new columns observe only: every column baseline.csv has must equal it,
# row for row, apart from the stamp and timing columns.
baseline        --decode-lat fixed:0 --rename-lat fixed:0 --dispatch-lat fixed:0 --execute-lat fixed:0 --resolve-commit fixed:0 --take-rate fixed:8 --window 0 --icache real --mispredict-rule fetch
